id-box\">67a39a72-f199-4b66-8abb-45ce9afbd9bf</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:67a39a72-f199-4b66-8abb-45ce9afbd9bf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:67a39a72-f199-4b66-8abb-45ce9afbd9bf\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Row_of_Books\" title=\"Row of Books\">Row of Books</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House#The_Counting_House_-_High_Security_Vaults\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Counting House\">Counting House High Security Vaults</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-712&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;850</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>An Archduke's Leadership: Verification\n</p><p><br>\nA pamphlet by the Gortash for Archduke voluntary campaign.\n</p><p><br>\nAs archduke, Lord Gortash's top priority will be Verification, to ensure that all those receiving the benefits of citizenship in Baldur's Gate are actually entitled to them. No policy can be more important.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Archduke%27s_Leadership:_Decorum\" title=\"An Archduke's Leadership: Decorum\">An Archduke's Leadership: Decorum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Archduke%27s_Leadership:_Discipline\" title=\"An Archduke's Leadership: Discipline\">An Archduke's Leadership: Discipline</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Archduke%27s_Leadership:_Public_Works\" title=\"An Archduke's Leadership: Public Works\">An Archduke's Leadership: Public Works</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Archduke%27s_Leadership:_Protection\" title=\"An Archduke's Leadership: Protection\">An Archduke's Leadership: Protection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Archduke%27s_Leadership:_Surveillance\" title=\"An Archduke's Leadership: Surveillance\">An Archduke's Leadership: Surveillance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Somewhat paradoxically, all Gortash's texts end with the proclamation, \"No policy can be more important.\"</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203026\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1860/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29965/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8812/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.0